Dell Outlet categorizes inventory into New (unopened), Certified Refurbished (tested/repaired to new condition), and Scratch & Dent (cosmetic blemishes only). All refurbished units receive identical limited hardware warranty as new products; 24-hour shipping and 30-day returns with free return shipping. Refurbished positioning allows Dell to clear returned units, clear inventory, and capture margin-sensitive segments without brand dilution. This three-tier product stratification enables price discrimination while maintaining quality assurance across all channels.